    "bbox": [
      321.36,
      333.6,
      562.13,
      391.67
    ],
    "text": "2. Lot No. 137Name of the Land: Katakalagahamulawaththa aliasDamunugahamulawaththa; Description: Garden; Claimant:Government; Original Claimant: Thanuja PriyadarshaniLiyanagama; Extent: 0.0102 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.36,
      404.4,
      562.28,
      522.47
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on whicha servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before meat Polgahawela Divisional Secretariat, on the day of the 29thof March 2017, at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 22nd ofMarch, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, theparticulars of their claims for computation for the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of thecomputation of such amount.",
